  "description": {
    "raw": "You create a nonmagical, unattended object of nonliving vegetable matter. The volume of the item created cannot exceed 1 cubic foot per caster level. You must succeed on an appropriate Craft skill check to make a complex item.\n\nAttempting to use any created object as a material component causes the spell to fail.",
